docs {
  Operation ID: `get-api-v1-oauth-authorized-applications`

  Requires the console session or the legacy login token (`Authorization: Token <key>`); personal API tokens and OAuth access tokens are rejected so a scoped credential can never mint a broader one. Read-only request.

  Django action: `apps.api.v1.oauth.views.AuthorizedApplicationViewSet.list`
  Source: `apps/api/v1/oauth/views.py`
}
